摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Magic Context for DeepSeek Harness: reversible context reclaim, an out-of-band historian, an m[0]/m[1] memory baseline, project memories, and the compaction seam.","id":"gh:1426867013","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-magic-context","slug":"wk544863858/dsh-plugin-magic-context","topics":["agent-memory","ai-agent","context-compaction","context-engineering","context-management","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","llm","magic-context","memory","nodejs","onnxruntime","sqlite","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Magic Context for DeepSeek Harness: reversible context reclaim, an out-of-band historian, an m[0]/m["},{"id":"p1s2","text":"1] memory baseline, project memories, and the compaction seam."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-magic-context — Magic Context adapter for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Anyone who has run long sessions knows the symptoms: the project details you worked out\n> yesterda"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"y are gone today, so the same pit gets re-dug; tool outputs bloat the context\n> window; and every co"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"mpaction busts the cache prefix, so the expensive part re-runs.\n>\n> Magic Context's answer: **knowle"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"dge should\n> persist, context should be managed.** This plugin gives **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)**\n> se"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"ssions a **persistent, project-aware memory** — knowledge distilled from your sessions\n> survives re"},{"id":"p4s6","text":"starts, is searchable with hybrid full-text + local vector search, and is\n> re-injected right where "},{"id":"p4s7","text":"the model reads it — while the context window itself is run as\n> an asset: tool results become tagge"},{"id":"p4s8","text":"d, reclaimable history, digests come back as\n> four-level summaries, and none of it ever breaks the "},{"id":"p4s9","text":"live KV-cache prefix."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Memory that outlives the session** — a project corpus in the plugin's own SQLite store;\nhistoria"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"n facts auto-promote into it, `ctx_memory` reads/writes/maintains it, and project\nidentity is auto-d"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"erived (git root or directory).\n- **Local-first retrieval** — MiniLM embeddings via WebAssembly (no "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"native build, no API\nkeys), hybrid full-text 0.7 / vector 0.3 ranking, fail-open to full-text on any"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" failure.\n- **Sharing with a human gate** — machine/org global domains: staging can be automated,\npu"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"blishing is always yours (approval cards, `/ctx-global approve`); a user-profile layer\nrides on top "},{"id":"p5s7","text":"with read / collect / review as separate switches.\n- **Reversible reclaim, cache-aware compaction** "},{"id":"p5s8","text":"— `ctx_reduce` only queues; drops land as\n`[dropped §N§]` placeholders and `ctx_expand` restores the"},{"id":"p5s9","text":" original; history digests into\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"After installing, the plugin hot-loads (no restart). In your next session:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Tool results carry `§N§` tags; a **telemetry badge** appears in the overlay showing live\ncontext o"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ccupancy, with a panel of live metrics and an operation record behind it.\n- A **settings card** for "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"the plugin shows up on the GUI Plugins page.\n- The `ctx_reduce` / `ctx_expand` / `ctx_memory` tools "},{"id":"p8s4","text":"are registered for the agent;\nproject memory is **on by default** — facts distilled by the historian"},{"id":"p8s5","text":" persist across\nsessions and surface where the model reads them."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Context reclaim, in one exchange (real parameter names):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The only opt-in surface is the compaction takeover (`registerCompactionEngine`, off by\ndefault — see"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"surface is the compaction takeover (`registerCompactionEngine`, off by\ndefault — see Configuration)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Memory first, context management second — the first five rows are the memory system, the\nlast five m"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"anage the context window (full design in Architecture and\nPARITY.md):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Capability | Mechanism |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **Project memory (own corpus)** | Plugin's own SQLite store (`memories.db`), hard-split from upstr"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"eam — no shared storage, no compatibility duty. Project identity auto-derived (`git:<root-sha>` / `d"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ir:<hash>`); injected into the m[0] baseline and served to `ctx_memory` for read/write; historian fa"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"cts auto-promote; FTS 0.7 / vector 0.3 hybrid retrieval |\n| **Local vector lane** | MiniLM embedding"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"s run locally via the bundled onnxruntime-web WASM backend — no native build, no API keys; the model"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" download is pinned by revision + sha256 (mirror fallback), cached in the plugin data dir; retrieval"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" candidates get inline + maintenance-tick backfill; any failure fails open to full-text search |\n| *"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"*m[0]/m[1] memory baseline** | A synthetic notice node carries the frozen baseline plus incremental "},{"id":"p15s9","text":"lanes (`<new-memories>` / `<memory-updates>` / `<user-profile>`); each lane keeps its own watermark,"},{"id":"p15s10","text":" so new memory never rebuilds the cached prefix — unchanged content produces zero diff |\n| **Global "},{"id":"p15s11","text":"domains + user profile** | machine/org domains: **staging can be automated** (maintenance tick, LLM "},{"id":"p15s12","text":"classification), **publishing is always human** (approval cards, `/ctx-global approve`); the user pr"},{"id":"p15s13","text":"ofile's render / collect / review are separate switches |\n| **Maintenance tick (MC dreamer slice)** "},{"id":"p15s14","text":"| Every 30 min: TTL archiving → batched LLM verify (keep / update / archive) → vector backfill → glo"},{"id":"p15s15","text":"bal-domain candidate staging |\n| **Reversible context reclaim** | Tool results get `§N§` tags; `ctx_"},{"id":"p15s16","text":"reduce` **only queues** — drops land in the execute band as `[dropped §N§]` placeholders referencing"},{"id":"p15s17","text":" the originals; `ctx_expand` restores the original text. The cached prefix is never busted spontaneo"},{"id":"p15s18","text":" `ctx_expand` restores the original text. The cached prefix is never busted spontaneously |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Isolation discipline (DSH is in developer preview; breaking changes are expected — this\npackage's st"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ine (DSH is in developer preview; breaking changes are expected — this\npackage's structural answer):"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Fail-loud capability probing**: `probeDshSeams` validates seam availability at boot and\nthrows w"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"hen absent — never silently pretends to manage context;\n- **Version fences**: the adapter DB schema "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"chain is at **v10** (forward migrations; a\nnewer DB refuses to open); the **own corpus** `memories.d"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"b` inherits the **v95** starting\npoint (switched 2026-10-13, numbering owned by this plugin; `MEMORY"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"_SCHEMA_MAX_VERSION`\nguards the migration line) — beyond it, reads refuse and writes degrade to read"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"-only\nwith a loud warning;\n- **Tests as probes**: the integration tests double as seam-contract test"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"s — rerun after a\nDSH upgrade and breakage localizes to `src/dsh/`;\n- **Two-database layout**:\n- **A"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"dapter DB** `~/.local/share/cortexkit/magic-context-dsh-poc/dsh-magic-context.db`\n(tags / usage / pe"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"nding_drops / compartments / baseline / domains / queues / journal…,\nschema v10);\n- **Own corpus** `"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"~/.local/share/cortexkit/magic-context-dsh-poc/memories.db` (project\nmemories + global-domain rows +"},{"id":"p19s11","text":" profile + vectors; the legacy `context.db` is sealed\nand unread — the 2026-10-13 hard split; the up"},{"id":"p19s12","text":"stream relationship is feature-following\nonly, no storage-compat duty);\n- **Upstream parity ledger**"},{"id":"p19s13","text":": effective-behavior alignment and deliberate differences\nagainst the OpenCode / Pi adapters are tra"},{"id":"p19s14","text":"cked in PARITY.md (aligned /\nhost-imposed / intentional verdicts, each citing host files)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
